p;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Freshness&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;As of last refresh&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Live&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;As of last framing (auto-updates ≈ near real time)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Query speed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Fastest — all in memory&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Slowest — SQL per visual&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Import-like once warm; first query pays transcoding&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Transformations&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Power Query, calculated columns&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Limited; pushed to source&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;None in model — shape upstream in Delta&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;When too large&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Capacity model-memory limit&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Source-bound&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;SKU guardrails → fallback to DirectQuery, or error&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
